    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be cyricbryce.] [B, Ld] ⁊ we cwædon be ciricbryce: gif he ful wære on ðam þryfealdan ordale, bete be þam þe sio dómboc secge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we have declared with regard to breaking into a church—if he [who is accused of doing so] is found guilty in the threefold ordeal, he shall pay such compensation for it as the written law declares.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Be cyricbryce.] And we cwædon be ciricbryce: gyf he fúl wære on ðam ðryfealdan ordale, [bete] be ðam ðe seo dómboc secge.</ab>
      </div>
